  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the S&#xe3;o Lu&#xed;s Enhancing Municipal Governance and Quality of Life Project is to improve public service in the Bacanga Basin of S&#xe3;o Lu&#xed;s Municipality, and enhance the capacity of the city government in promoting local economic development and municipal management.</narrative>
  </description>
